5× (candidates 6, 0 and 4):** storage costs grow much faster than the shortages they prevent. These plans also start hitting the 284-unit capacity limit near the day-22–23 peak, and anything that doesn't fit is lost after being paid for.\n\n**How often to order.**\n- **Daily vs every other day:** ordering every other day saves 14 order fees × 43 = 602. It costs about 610 in extra storage, because roughly one day's demand sits on the shelf overnight in each cycle. Ordering two days at once also loses slightly fewer sales, which is worth about 100, so every other day comes out a little ahead.\n- **Every three days (candidate 3):** this saves only another 172 in fees but adds about 600 in storage. The day-18 order of 202 units of item 0 also overflows the warehouse.\n\n**Ranking:** 5 > 1 ≈ 7 > 2 > 6 > 0 > 3 > 4."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3894, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3894}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-19T02:37:02.829Z", "request_id": "req_011CgApBHpAY5jTJkk6h6vFf"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015112RnkeVaPS6SENS82Kbt", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgApBJGSmmSmJ7uPQ6L3t", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015112RnkeVaPS6SENS82Kbt", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input